    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/94038efbdcac40175061f11c1913a80d.poster.avif?t=1726147001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/94038efbdcac40175061f11c1913a80d.webm?t=1726147001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/94038efbdcac40175061f11c1913a80d.mp4?t=1726147001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/9a24600dbe18e36e5013e0a5ca0b9c06.avif?t=1726147001\" /></div><br>Ghost Blood is the game that will take you on an unforgettable journey of discovery and adventure. As the hero in Ghost Blood, you'll explore a forgotten cemetery where an ancient evil still reigns and discover the mystery of magic that once empowered your ancestors to fight against dragons and chaos. With the only remaining book that holds the key to superhuman strength, you'll solve its secrets and embark on a quest to find the mysterious potions.<br><br>But be warned, the ancient evil still lurks, and you must be prepared to face its dangers and challenges if you hope to claim the power of magic for yourself. In Ghost Blood, you'll experience a world brought to life with stunning graphics and realistic sounds as you solve challenging puzzles, complete quests, and absorb yourself in a deep and dynamic action game. With an inventory system and quest system at your disposal, you'll be able to collect and use powerful items and weapons to help you in your journey.<br><br>Take advantage of this opportunity to become a part of a new era of magic and power. Take up the challenge and become the first of a new breed of magicians in Ghost Blood. Get ready to embark on an epic adventure and claim your place in the annals of magic!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/af882f646ae7e244a7b2c653f3d11681.avif?t=1726147001\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A vast and ever-changing world shaped by your choices<br></li><li>Brain-teasing puzzles and immersive quests<br></li><li>Stunning graphics and realistic audio<br></li><li>A rich and engaging storyline<br></li><li>High-octane action gameplay<br></li><li>An intuitive inventory system to manage your items<br></li><li>A comprehensive quest system to track your progress</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/94038efbdcac40175061f11c1913a80d.poster.avif?t=1726147001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/94038efbdcac40175061f11c1913a80d.webm?t=1726147001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/94038efbdcac40175061f11c1913a80d.mp4?t=1726147001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/9a24600dbe18e36e5013e0a5ca0b9c06.avif?t=1726147001\" /></div><br>Ghost Blood is the game that will take you on an unforgettable journey of discovery and adventure. As the hero in Ghost Blood, you'll explore a forgotten cemetery where an ancient evil still reigns and discover the mystery of magic that once empowered your ancestors to fight against dragons and chaos. With the only remaining book that holds the key to superhuman strength, you'll solve its secrets and embark on a quest to find the mysterious potions.<br><br>But be warned, the ancient evil still lurks, and you must be prepared to face its dangers and challenges if you hope to claim the power of magic for yourself. In Ghost Blood, you'll experience a world brought to life with stunning graphics and realistic sounds as you solve challenging puzzles, complete quests, and absorb yourself in a deep and dynamic action game. With an inventory system and quest system at your disposal, you'll be able to collect and use powerful items and weapons to help you in your journey.<br><br>Take advantage of this opportunity to become a part of a new era of magic and power. Take up the challenge and become the first of a new breed of magicians in Ghost Blood. Get ready to embark on an epic adventure and claim your place in the annals of magic!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625110/extras/af882f646ae7e244a7b2c653f3d11681.avif?t=1726147001\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A vast and ever-changing world shaped by your choices<br></li><li>Brain-teasing puzzles and immersive quests<br></li><li>Stunning graphics and realistic audio<br></li><li>A rich and engaging storyline<br></li><li>High-octane action gameplay<br></li><li>An intuitive inventory system to manage your items<br></li><li>A comprehensive quest system to track your progress</li></ul><br>",
